    {
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Apply the declared index-list query parameters**\n\nWhen an installation has many configured indexes or the console supplies search/filter/pagination input, `listIndexes` ignores the entire input and always returns every index with `nextCursor: null`. This contradicts the operation's cursor-pagination declaration and makes the resource-list search UI return unrelated entries while bypassing the declared 200-item maximum; honor `limit`, `cursor`, and the advertised query fields before building the result.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-21T16:01:33Z",
