    {
      "body": "**Security:** Mutation authorization is selected from the HTTP method rather than the matched operation's safety classification. Capability validation currently allows a `GET` route whose classification is `write` or `destructive`, so that operation is dispatched without `authorizeMutation` (and therefore without provider CSRF/re-auth checks). Please either reject non-read operations on safe HTTP methods during manifest validation or authorize after matching based on `entry.operation.safety.classification`.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-21T16:08:47Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831799619",
      "id": 3831799619,
