    {
      "body": "This does not pass the package's own typecheck: `npm run typecheck --workspace superconsole` reports that `code` is not part of SvelteKit's `Error`, followed by two errors where `+error.svelte` reads `page.error.code` and `.details`. Please declare the intended `App.Error` shape in `src/app.d.ts` (or restrict these routes to the standard error shape) so the checked package is type-safe.",
