"1\" location=\"superconsole/src/lib/server/transport.ts:25\">\nP2: When an installation sets `apiBasePath` to anything other than `/api/admin/v1`, the mounted transport cannot serve it: custom-path requests do not match these routes, while requests at the fixed path are rejected as outside the configured API. Constrain this option for the SvelteKit transport or mount/delegate routes using the configured base path.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"filefn/server/src/authz/grants.service.ts\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"filefn/server/src/authz/grants.service.ts:97\">\nP2: When grants share a millisecond timestamp, offset-based admin pages can reorder tied rows and duplicate or skip grants. Add `permissionId` as a secondary sort key.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"uifn/components-svelte/package.json\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"uifn/components-svelte/package.json:13\">\nP2: The `generate`, `generate:check`, and `prepack` scripts invoke `../../scripts/generate-uifn-components.mjs`, but that file does not exist anywhere in the repo (the `scripts/` directory has no such entry). Running `npm run generate` or `npm run generate:check` fails, and because `prepack` runs `npm run generate:check && npm run build`, `npm publish` aborts. Add the generation script or remove these scripts if the committed `src/generated` output is the intended source of truth.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"packages/admin/src/risk-review.ts\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"packages/admin/src/risk-review.ts:15\">\nP2: When an AuthFn session mutation is named `authfn.sessions.*`, the risk review omits it because the regex only matches `auth-session(s)`. Match the manifest's `sessions` resource so session credential-lifecycle mutations are included in the fail-closed report.</violation>\n\n<violation number=\"2\" location=\"packages/admin/src/risk-review.ts:16\">\nP2: When a channel is connected or disconnected, `reviewAdminMutationRisks` emits no external