nP2: When the admin artifact list spans pages, artifacts created in the same millisecond can move between pages because `listArtifacts` orders only by non-unique `createdAt`. Add a unique tie-breaker such as `artifactId` to the ordering.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"superconsole/src/lib/components/ResourceDetailPage.svelte\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"superconsole/src/lib/components/ResourceDetailPage.svelte:36\">\nP2: When two detail fields have the same label, Svelte raises a duplicate-key error and the resource detail page fails to render. Key the loop with a unique field identity or index instead.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"superconsole/src/routes/search/+page.ts\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"superconsole/src/routes/search/+page.ts:19\">\nP2: When a query matches more than the server's default 25 results, this load renders only the first page and discards `nextCursor`, so operators cannot reach the remaining matches despite the displayed total. Propagate the cursor and add a follow-up pagination or load-more path.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"superconsole/src/routes/api/+page.svelte\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"superconsole/src/routes/api/+page.svelte:22\">\nP2: When an unauthenticated operator opens `/api`, the page shows an error with “Retry” instead of a sign-in action. Handle status 401 separately and link to `/sign-in`, as the overview route does.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"uifn/adapter-kit/src/ssr.ts\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"uifn/adapter-kit/src/ssr.ts:38\">\nP2: When consumers destructure `runClient`, client calls throw because `this` is undefined. Use the local environment check or a closure instead of `this.assertClient`.</violation>\n</file>\n\n<file name=\"packages/admin/scripts/verify-sdk-contracts.mjs\">\n\n<violation number=\"1\" location=\"packages/admin/scripts/verify-sdk-contracts.mjs:41\">\nP2: When the function admin builds have not run, this script silently