            "line": 56,
            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve numeric-looking string document IDs**\n\nFor a composite target such as `orders:001`, this converts the document ID from the string `\"001\"` to the number `1`. Single-document indexing therefore targets a different ID than batch indexing, which preserves string IDs, and `remove-document` can delete numeric document `1` instead of string document `\"001\"`. Preserve the ID suffix as a string or carry explicit ID-type information in the input.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
